# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# `nuxt generate` copies public/ verbatim into the output root, which is where
# Pages looks for this file. Nothing here is enforced at build time, so changes
# must be verified against the deployed response, not assumed.
#
# The policy is strict because the site earns it: every page is prerendered,
# fonts are self-hosted (public/fonts), there is no analytics, no third-party
# script and no outbound request to any third party. If any of that changes, this
# file changes with it — see docs note in server/api/README.md. The single
# exception is a loopback connect-src, explained below.
#
# `style-src 'unsafe-inline'`: the tools bind computed colours through :style
# (pages/tools/contrast-checker.vue, components/tools/ColorPickerField.vue), which
# is inline style by construction. Low risk here because no untrusted input
# reaches a style sink — every value is a normalised hex from utils/tools/color.ts —
# but it is a deliberate exception, not an oversight.
#
# `script-src 'self'`: verify against a real `nuxt generate` output. If Nuxt emits
# an inline hydration script, add its sha256 hash here rather than reaching for
# 'unsafe-inline'. The hashes are injected at build time by
# scripts/inject-csp-hashes.mjs, which rewrites this directive and nothing else.
#
# `connect-src 'self' http://localhost:11434 http://127.0.0.1:11434`: the one
# outbound exception on the whole site, added for the prompt field of
# /tools/layout-builder. It is a loopback address, so the request cannot leave the
# visitor's own machine — the claim that nothing leaves the browser still holds,
# which is exactly why that tool talks to a local Ollama and refuses to accept a
# hosted API key. If a hosted provider is ever added, this line stops being
# defensible and the copy on /tools and /about has to change with it.
#
# Loopback is exempt from mixed-content blocking (it counts as a potentially
# trustworthy origin), so an https page may call it. Ollama still has to opt in
# to the origin itself: `OLLAMA_ORIGINS=https://vantra.design ollama serve`.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' http://localhost:11434 http://127.0.0.1:11434; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; manifest-src 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# Fonts are immutable and fingerprint-free, so they are safe to cache hard.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/_nuxt/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
